; The level gate's cosmetic follow-up (a friend's restyle) is queued
; here and drained one per tick. The gate itself keeps the pace, the
; venue for this level, the garden scene, the banner, coins, and the
; chase queue. A clear does not recombine a new world. Each entry is a
; thunk; maybe-gate-followup! runs at most one per tick.
(define gate-followups (list))
; True only on the tick that crossed a level gate. finish-level! sets it
; inside pump!; the cosmetic trial drainers (tune, gate follow-up, and a
; slice seal) stand down for that one tick so three trials do not stack on
; the crossing frame. Cleared at the top of the next on-tick. The verdicts
; are unchanged — they land a tick later, the same slice convention the
; dream / card / chase already use.
